/E (At NCCADV, a 5-Year Trend Analysis of Domestic Violence Data in North Carolina was conducted to highlight key trends in DV data over 5 years \(2018-2023\), with a focus on insights relevant to the challenges posed by the COVID-19 pandemic. )
/Pg 16 0 R
/K [2 399 0 R 4]
>>
