246 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 168 0 R
/E (To understand the effects of COVID-19 and its impact on DV agencies, NCCADV joined with 24 other state coalitions to better understand the needs of professional domestic violence advocates. To gather insights, storytelling circles were convened where advocates could share their experiences and connect with other advocates while integrating data collection through demographic and reflective surveys. The ReStoryation project in North Carolina has provided critical insights into the needs and experiences of domestic violence advocates, particularly during the peak of the COVID-19 pandemic. )
/Pg 18 0 R
/K [4]
>>
endobj
247 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
