249 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 168 0 R
/E (A total of 1,322 domestic and sexual violence providers completed the ReStoryation survey nationally. The majority of participants identified as female, heterosexual, and aged 18 to 44. Nearly 50% of these workers are survivors themselves and share their experiences to educate and connect with others. Most worked directly with survivors, underscoring the need to address burnout and vicarious trauma in the field. The mental strain experienced by advocates was intensified by financial and emotional hardships resulting from the pandemic. In the aftermath, worker challenges were compounded by job insecurity and staff turnover.)
/Pg 18 0 R
/K [7]
>>
endobj
