/T (The ReStoryation report highlights the emotional, financial, and structural challenges faced by the advocacy workforce and emphasizes the importance of workplace wellness and support systems. The findings underscore the urgent need for trauma-informed workplace policies, consistent funding, and enhanced mental health and financial support for advocates. )
