359 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 175 0 R
/E (Nisha G. Williams is a dedicated attorney with a strong emphasis on domestic violence law. As the Legal Director at the North Carolina Coalition Against Domestic Violence \(NCCADV\), she plays a vital role in assisting survivors in obtaining restraining orders and ensuring they receive trauma-informed legal support through statewide training and advocacy initiatives. Deeply committed to ending domestic violence, she actively advocates for systemic changes that empower survivors and improve access to justice in the community.)
/Pg 25 0 R
/K [10]
>>
endobj
