362 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 175 0 R
/E (Ruhani Amin is the Communications and Data Visualization Coordinator at the North Carolina Coalition Against Domestic Violence \(NCCADV\). In this role, she leads digital communications and transforms complex data into accessible, actionable information for advocates, policymakers, and communities across North Carolina. She manages the Coalition's digital resources, creates data visualizations and develops reports that support evidence-informed decision-making in domestic violence prevention and survivor advocacy. Ruhani holds a Master of Science in Information Technology and Management with a concentration in Business Analytics from the University of North Carolina at Greensboro. Her expertise combines data analysis, visualization, and strategic communications to help translate research and program data into practical tools that strengthen prevention efforts and inform public policy. She is passionate about using data storytelling to make information more accessible and drive meaningful change.)
/Pg 25 0 R
/K [14]
>>
endobj
