/E (Patricia A. Harris is the Founder and Executive Director of Women Veterans Support Services, Inc. \(WVSS, Inc.\), North Carolina's first nonprofit dedicated to supporting women veterans and their families. A U.S. Army combat veteran, servant leader, domestic violence \(DV\) and military sexual trauma \(MST\) survivor, and military culture consultant, Patricia has transformed her own journey into a mission of hope and healing for others. For nearly two decades, she has stood beside survivors, helping them find safety, strength, and a path forward. Her passion is rooted in the belief that every survivor deserves to be seen, heard, and supported with dignity and compassion. Patricia's message is simple yet powerful: No veteran or survivor should ever have to suffer in silence.)
